WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.670
- And I heard you actually hurt yourself

00:00:01.670 --> 00:00:02.530
in the first number.

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:03.363
- [Derek] I did.

00:00:03.363 --> 00:00:04.880
- And then had to bandage
yourself up and keep going.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:08.030
- Listen, I just finished
like a 56 city tour,

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:09.650
out on stage for two hours nonstop

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:11.390
and then the very first
move of the special

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:14.020
I came out and did like a
little James Brown split

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:15.508
and I ripped my hamstring.

00:00:15.508 --> 00:00:16.920
(Kelly gasps)

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:18.886
Yeah and I did that with a (yells).

00:00:18.886 --> 00:00:19.722
(audience laughs)

00:00:19.722 --> 00:00:21.972
♪ Ain't no business like show business ♪

00:00:21.972 --> 00:00:23.437
You gotta keep going, right?
- You just kept going

00:00:23.437 --> 00:00:25.090
like Beyonce, all right.

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:27.330
- Taped it up with duct tape
and then just kept goin'

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:30.240
and honestly, you know,
luckily you can't really tell

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.770
but I definitely, the
tears rolling down my eyes

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:34.020
while I'm smiling.

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:35.080
Ladies and gentlemen.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.312
- I'm so happy about Christmas!

00:00:36.312 --> 00:00:37.145
(Julianne cries)

00:00:37.145 --> 00:00:37.978
So happy!

00:00:37.978 --> 00:00:39.060
And you also released a song, right?

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:40.800
A new song, like an
anthem for 2020, right?

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:42.071
- Yeah, you know 2020's coming up,

00:00:42.071 --> 00:00:43.580
it's a beginning of a new decade

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:46.121
and there's a song called "Say
It Now" and it's out there.

00:00:46.121 --> 00:00:48.150
It's about sort of acting
in the moment, you know,

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:48.983
saying it right now.

00:00:48.983 --> 00:00:49.930
There's no time like the present.

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:52.040
We're often like, someday I'll do this,

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:52.912
someday I'll do that.

00:00:52.912 --> 00:00:54.503
There's a good expression that says

00:00:54.503 --> 00:00:57.230
the path of someday leads
to a town called Nowhere.

00:00:57.230 --> 00:00:58.310
Right, we keep putting it off.

00:00:58.310 --> 00:00:59.730
So it's sorta like, let's do it right now.

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:01.060
So yeah.

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:02.300
- All right, all right!

